														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-3922156">
									

<p>There's a simmering sense of realism behind this that both pollutes it and makes it meaningful. I didn't read the author post before I finished reading, but by the end I had a very good idea of what that post was going to be (even if I never knew the details behind it). It was the combination of the monolithic atmosphere of this presentation of the Foundation and also the fact that it did indeed feel real that kept my attention throughout.</p>
<p>I don't feel qualified to comment any more than that, but I do feel qualified to upvote.</p>
<p>Also, the DPI is awesome.</p>

